Capacity 0.09 t | Series 8905
Multi Function Vehicle 
Vehicle for versatile warehouse applications
â†’ Overall length of only 1440 millimetres ensures easy manoeuvrability
â†’ Platform lift up to 3 metres enables order picking on the second and third racking level
â†’ Stable structure for load capacity up to 100 kilograms
â†’ Li-ION battery can be charged at any time and increases vehicle availability
